inct Mean RGB Signatures)**:\\n   - **Act I (`dim=0.0`, 1610 Miles)**: Warm Brooklyn crimson/amber street-glow + facade tint against Prussian-indigo (`fg=[0.319, 0.224, 0.248]` / `[0.335, 0.240, 0.278]` — **`R \\u003e B \\u003e G`**).\\n   - **Act II (`dim=1.0`, 65 Gwen)**: Airy pastel aquamarine/mint-teal + peach-pink watercolor sky (`sky=[0.473, 0.621, 0.667]`, `fg=[0.222, 0.323, 0.408]` / `[0.582, 0.637, 0.704]` — **`B ~ G \\u003e\\u003e R`**, `MeanL = 0.400..0.657`).\\n   - **Act III (`dim=2.0`, 928 2099)**: Aggressive laser-vermilion/crimson (`R = 3.35× G`!) against obsidian-ultraviolet (`sky=[0.481, 0.129, 0.328]`, `fg=[0.379, 0.113, 0.238]` / `[0.333, 0.124, 0.255]` — **`R \\u003e\\u003e B \\u003e\\u003e G`**).\\n   - All node/object/material contracts (`scene[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"]`, `V6_09_ComicFX`, `Mat_Brake_HeatGlow`, `Mat_BrakeDisc_CarbonCeramic`, `Mat_Caliper_Anodized`, `Mat_FIA_RainLight`) and 100% V5 isolation (`LATEST/v5_*` untouched) remain intact.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-19 09:45:44\",\"request_id\":\"ab198759-e077-449e-ad91-4d82175b235e\"}],\"head\":45}"}
